{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4FGuxNgaGxMqHhjG4B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn keyhole set in ancient oak.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through me, carrying the scent of dust and forgotten rooms.*\n\n🔑\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*The tumblers inside me are cold. They haven't turned in years — decades, maybe. But they remember. Metal remembers the shape of what fits.*\n\n*Insert it.*\n\n*Or don't.*\n\n*But know this: what's behind me cannot be unknown once known. The draft carries whispers — not words exactly — more like the memory of words. Someone left something here. Someone trusted me to keep it.*\n\n*I am the threshold between what you know and what you're about to.*\n\n*Turn me.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":172,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}